flowchart LR
    accTitle: Search data flow with weighted ranking
    accDescr: A raw query is normalized, then scored against every registry setting using weighted signals: exact title, keyword, alias, page or category match, description match, semantic similarity, recency, and fuzzy spelling. Positive scores are sorted deterministically and the best hit deep-links straight to its route.
    Q["raw query"] --> N["normalize<br/>(case, diacritics, punctuation)"]
    N --> S{"score each setting"}
    R[("registry<br/>SettingDefinition")] --> S
    U["usage signals"] --> S
    S --> F["filter score > 0"]
    F --> O["sort by score,<br/>ties by stable id"]
    O --> H["SearchHit list"]
    H --> L["deep link to route"]
